# Allow-list build context for Dockerfile.api, Dockerfile.sandbox and
# Dockerfile.actions: everything is excluded unless listed below, so local
# secrets and state (.env, .venv, data/, *.db, keys, caches) never reach an image:
# an API started from an image must not publish a development checkout's receipts.
# Each Dockerfile then copies only the paths its process needs.
# tests/images/ builds the images from a checkout with planted secrets.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!sandbox_config.yml
!autograder/
!execution_host/
!github_action/
!sandbox_manager/
!web/

# Never, even inside an allowed directory.
**/.env*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.db
**/*.pem
**/*.key
sandbox_manager/images
